# The proofs of proofs.list the Proofs workflow leaves out, each with
# why: CI gives a proof the 14 GB and 60 minutes .github/scripts/proofs.sh
# caps it at, and these need more on a 16-core host. Run each by hand
# after a change to what it reads, make proofs-cbmc PROOFS=<proof> under
# the memory cap of the proofs skill, and take it off once it fits.
bpm-tree-sync-model		no result after 7 hours, past 15 GB
bpm-tree-sync-application	no result after 7 hours, past 15 GB
bpm-tree-sync-pending		no result after 7 hours, past 15 GB
bpm-tree-sync-walk		no result after 7 hours, past 15 GB
bpm-tree-recovery-model		76 to 97 minutes, once no result in 2 hours
